This repository is an Asymchem / 凯莱英 BLA retrofit workbench.

Before drafting client emails, translations, slides, minutes, or action items, read the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/`:

- Client-facing wording → `client-comms`
- Chinese/English regulatory or CMC text → `cn-en-regulatory-translation` plus `references/glossary.md`
- Meeting minutes, decisions, action tracking → `meeting-minutes-and-actions`
- PowerPoint / 汇报材料 → `presentation-deck` and `theme-factory`

Write minutes into `meetings/` as Word/PDF. Track actions only in `meetings/POA生物制品项目改造-行动项跟踪.xlsx` (single sheet 行动项总账). Never add Excel cell comments/notes or data-validation input popups. Write decks into `deliverables/pptx/`. Mark unverified facts as 待核实. Do not invent regulatory conclusions or unauthorized commitments.
